    "default": "contributions",
    "description": "Which group of figures: contributions (AHV/ALV/UVG/withholding tax), thresholds, minimum_wages, pension_bvg, in_kind_wage (board and lodging), sick_pay, au_pair_geneva, iv_assistance (IV Assistenzbeitrag), or all.",
